{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01240",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 4.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Hello, good to see you. Please sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 5.75,
      "end_seconds": 12.93,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "Mm, hello, doctor. I'm here with them in case I can help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.05,
      "end_seconds": 20.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 22.3,
      "end_seconds": 24.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "We came because of lightheadedness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.44,
      "end_seconds": 28.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Okay, when did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.25,
      "end_seconds": 36.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "I've had it for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.38,
      "end_seconds": 44.62,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Is it there all the time or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.72,
      "end_seconds": 67.27,
      "duration_seconds": 20.55,
      "text": "Honestly, a few times a day. As for palpitations, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. As for palpitations, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.24,
      "end_seconds": 72.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Any shortness of breath with it as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.42,
      "end_seconds": 77.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Yes, you know, since Friday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.12,
      "end_seconds": 84.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "What's on your current medicine list? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.14,
      "end_seconds": 96.59,
      "duration_seconds": 10.45,
      "text": "I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety. Thyronorm, 50 micrograms, maybe, every morning for my thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.5,
      "end_seconds": 102.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.36,
      "end_seconds": 111.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Mm, no, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.14,
      "end_seconds": 115.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.53,
      "end_seconds": 122.96,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Ah, yes, I had a bunion operation, six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.56,
      "end_seconds": 127.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.38,
      "end_seconds": 131.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "I've got anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.09,
      "end_seconds": 132.79,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.41,
      "end_seconds": 137.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "I have an underactive thyroid."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.06,
      "end_seconds": 145.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.43,
      "text": "Yes, anxiety is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.07,
      "end_seconds": 158.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.1,
      "end_seconds": 164.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "Hmm, I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.11,
      "end_seconds": 185.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "So, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.45,
      "end_seconds": 191.55,
      "duration_seconds": 5.1,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.15,
      "end_seconds": 193.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.83,
      "end_seconds": 197.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.82,
      "end_seconds": 201.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Alright, is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.47,
      "end_seconds": 208.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.07,
      "end_seconds": 211.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Any fever, chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.01,
      "end_seconds": 219.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.98,
      "text": "I haven't had fever, chest pain or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.56,
      "end_seconds": 224.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "And what about leg swelling or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.35,
      "end_seconds": 228.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Right, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.53,
      "end_seconds": 233.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.13,
      "end_seconds": 235.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.42,
      "end_seconds": 241.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.91,
      "end_seconds": 243.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.09,
      "text": "No rashes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.29,
      "end_seconds": 249.77,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Let me look at the area, I'll be gentle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.58,
      "end_seconds": 252.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Fine by me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.01,
      "end_seconds": 256.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.64,
      "end_seconds": 267.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Pulse is irregular right now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.25,
      "end_seconds": 287.21,
      "duration_seconds": 15.96,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. Let me tell you where I've got to. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a possible heart rhythm problem like atrial fibrillation, or it might be anxiety-related palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 288.43,
      "end_seconds": 291.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.4,
      "end_seconds": 302.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a possible heart rhythm problem like atrial fibrillation is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.17,
      "end_seconds": 315.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "I think an echocardiogram makes sense here, for palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.32,
      "end_seconds": 319.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 320.83,
      "end_seconds": 330.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "I'd like you to take metoprolol, 25 milligrams, twice a day, until we review. You take it by mouth. That's for palpitations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.99,
      "end_seconds": 332.78,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "That's simple enough."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.97,
      "end_seconds": 360.12,
      "duration_seconds": 26.15,
      "text": "Cut back on tea, coffee and energy drinks, and note the time whenever it happens. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like to see you again after the results are back. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.66,
      "end_seconds": 366.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Uh, uh, great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}